This CryptoNight module is based on Equim-chan/cryptonight at
ca7522515170f26ccb3de2c0ebf5e59d01f9a07b and its BlockdagNetworkLabs fork
at aa4cf9dc20f8; the original module MIT license is retained in LICENSE.
The jh and groestl implementations have been replaced by the independently
authored sphlib implementations by Thomas Pornin, Projet RNRT SAPHIR, at
https://github.com/pornin/sphlib/tree/15b6b8d8f3e4a43c58ba102d712fa6b8a3317035/c.
Their MIT licenses and original notices are retained in the relevant files
and LICENSE.sphlib. The Go interfaces in jh/hash.go and groestl/hash.go are
new BlockDAG community work provided under GPL-3.0-or-later.
The C compiler is required to build these two packages.
The internal/aes and internal/sha3 packages include Go Authors code under
the BSD-3-Clause license, reproduced in each package directory.
